<title>POLAND: PPWK TO BUY-UP SHARES, SETS NO DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>PPWK TO BUY-UP SHARES, SETS NO DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Polish Polskie Przedsiebiorstwo Wydawnictw Kartograficznych SA (PPWK) decided on Friday that 18 percent of the firm's 1996 net profit would be earmarked for a share buy-up, PPWK said in a statement.</p>
<p>PPWK said 812,240 zlotys of its about 4.5-million-zloty net profit will be earmarked for the buy-up and said the shares would later be retired. The company set no 1996 payout.</p>
<p>It said 3.5 million zlotys of last year's net profit would be earmarked for a development fund and 200,000 zlotys for a social fund. It did not give any other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
